Data in this Space

data/osm/<city>-roads.osm.pbf, for chennai, mumbai, bengaluru, hyderabad,
kolkata and delhi

    Road networks of six Indian cities, extracted from OpenStreetMap.
    © OpenStreetMap contributors.
    Available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0:
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
    Copyright and attribution: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

    Each file is a filtered extract (highway ways and their nodes) of the
    OpenStreetMap data for that city's area. They are derivative databases
    and are offered under the same licence. The live map's base tiles come
    from OpenFreeMap and carry their own OpenStreetMap and OpenMapTiles
    attribution in the map corner.

